# Allowlist for Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.
# Default: ignore everything in the repo root. Then un-ignore only what
# should be publicly served. Anything new in the repo is NOT served unless
# its path is added here, by design — this prevents future leaks of
# build tooling, configs, or accidentally-checked-in secrets.

*

!*.html
!llms.txt
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml

!academy/
!academy/**
!company/
!company/**
!legal/
!legal/**
!public/
!public/**
